<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Follow Excitement!</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Rizzle Kicks, Rachel Chinouriri</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Follow Excitement!</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3kmNmUivuxN6zhOWTpi0Gx</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.000" end="00:02.389">I don't know, but I like it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:02.389" end="00:04.536">I'm tryna follow excitement</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:04.536" end="00:06.975">We don't need much to light it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.975" end="00:08.475">Just a little bit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.221" end="00:09.721" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.279" end="00:09.863">Yeah, ain't nobody stopping me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.863" end="00:12.094">Ate my greens, yeah, ate all of my broccoli</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.094" end="00:14.355">You wanna beef? Well, at least do it properly</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.355" end="00:16.476">Ain't got a chance, this ain't even monopoly</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.476" end="00:18.985">It can't be you, this ain't even the lottery</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.985" end="00:23.067">Only thing I'm tryna smash nowadays is the glass in the ceiling on top of me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.067" end="00:25.151">I'm trying to be peaceful and worry free</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.151" end="00:27.313">But some of these need a lobotomy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.313" end="00:28.813">Honestly</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.078" end="00:30.339">Played ball, now it's time for another kick</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.339" end="00:32.481">Already got a bunch ticked off the bucket list</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.481" end="00:34.803">Never had love, found love, now I'm loving in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.803" end="00:37.192">Real talk, man, I hope you discover it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.192" end="00:40.468">No shortcuts in life, man, you gotta be aligned with the suffering</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.468" end="00:41.968">Can't start ducking it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.648" end="00:44.680">You gotta pick your battles, but right now this ain't even a challenge</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.680" end="00:46.180">I'm just brushing up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.657" end="00:47.157" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.667" end="00:48.098">I don't know, but I like it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.098" end="00:50.198">I'm tryna follow excitement</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.198" end="00:52.748">We don't need much to light it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.748" end="00:54.826">Just a little bit, just a little bit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.826" end="00:56.326" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.837" end="00:57.088">I don't know, but I like it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.088" end="00:59.313">I'm tryna follow excitement</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.313" end="01:01.780">We don't need much to light it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.780" end="01:03.992">Just a little bit, just a little bit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.992" end="01:11.992" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.748" end="01:18.277">Uh, add a little spice to the rhythm, cook it up, smelling real nice in the kitchen, voila</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.277" end="01:22.630">Yes, he did, no, he didn't, she said, "Rizzle Kicks are back," now she livin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.630" end="01:26.058">Hey, mum, look I'm on the telly, tryna put food in my belly</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.058" end="01:29.945">Givin' it some welly, even if it's straight from the heart, it might not chart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.945" end="01:31.620">So you might as well dance like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.620" end="01:33.609">Bop your head and hit a two-step</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.609" end="01:35.945">Bop your head and hit a two-step</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.945" end="01:38.215">Bop your head and hit a two-step</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.215" end="01:41.101">Spin it 'round, givin' roulette, uh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.101" end="01:42.760">Wave bye-bye as I go up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.760" end="01:44.476">Top floor, down where I show up</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.476" end="01:46.690">Everything I do, yeah, everything's a grower</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.690" end="01:48.909">You can't constrict me, I ain't no boa</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.909" end="01:50.409" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.439" end="01:52.184">I don't know, but I like it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.184" end="01:54.264">I'm tryna follow excitement</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.264" end="01:56.576">We don't need much to light it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.576" end="01:58.821">Just a little bit, just a little bit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.821" end="02:00.321" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.822" end="02:01.202">I don't know, but I like it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.202" end="02:03.316">I'm tryna follow excitement</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.316" end="02:05.718">We don't need much to light it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.718" end="02:07.984">Just a little bit, just a little bit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.984" end="02:11.560" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.560" end="02:16.110">Just a little bit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.110" end="02:20.759">Just a little bit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.759" end="02:25.253">Just a little bit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.253" end="02:29.253">Just a little bit</p></div></body></tt>